'''Wookiees''', known in their own language of [[Shyriiwook]] as "'''the People of the Trees'''," were a [[species]] of tall, [[hair]]y [[humanoid]]s that were native to the [[planet]] [[Kashyyyk]]. A notable member of this species was the warrior [[Chewbacca]], [[Han Solo]]'s best friend and co-[[pilot]], who played a vital role in the [[Clone Wars]] during the [[Battle of Kashyyyk]], the [[Galactic Civil War]] by aiding the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]] in their fight against the [[Galactic Emperor|Galactic Empire]], and the [[First Order-Resistance War|war]] against the [[First Order]]. They were quite strong, and were known to rip people's arms out of their sockets when provoked. Though being from a temperate planet known for its [[swamp]]s and [[forest]]s, Wookiees were perfectly comfortable on icy worlds like [[Ilum]] and [[Hoth]], not requiring any additional protective [[clothing]], i.e. [[glove]]s or [[boot]]s.

